  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The Saint Inky Train corporation has received a bomb threat and invited
    you, a top ranking bomb disposal expert with over 150 1,000 pound, 78 1,900 pound
    ones and even 34 4,000 pound ones, not counting the thousands of minor ones,
    onto the train to find and defuse a bomb should it be found. Of course your wife
    Mara was worried sick and tired to stop you from going but when duty calls and
    lifes are on the line there is nothing that stops you from being the hero! So
    far the train ride has been pretty calm. Apart from a few false alarms, you were
    able to spend most of the time in your sleeping compartment reading the newspaper
    and watching the snowy mountains pass by the window. Up until a few seconds ago
    when another officer burst into the room to let you know that the bomb had been
    found. This time for real. The only issue: It had already been activated and
    the timer till the big explosion should be at about 5 minutes now. \r\nSo you
    better hurry up and get to that bomb in time to defuse it! Else the thousands
    of passengers on this train will DIE!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
